OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers will be less frequent
OL,6,Fand lighter than recent days, though
OL,7,Fsome heavy or thundery downpours
OL,8,Fremain possible. These are most likely
OL,9,Facross Wales and southwestern England
OL,10,Fand parts of eastern and southeastern
OL,11,Fareas. Northern Ireland turns drier
OL,12,Flater.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FMost showers will fade
OL,15,Fallowing clear spells to develop. A
OL,16,Ffew showers will persist around
OL,17,Fexposed coasts. It will become rather
OL,18,Fchilly overnight, especially in rural
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
