OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FCoastal showers will
OL,6,Fgradually ease, leaving most areas dry
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Cloud will thicken
OL,8,Facross northern Scotland, bringing
OL,9,Fsome light rain. Temperatures around
OL,10,Faverage after a chilly start.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
